  "explanation": "The question asks how many buildings are included in the Danville Historic District. Multiple documents provide conflicting counts depending on the specific district and time period referenced:\n\n- **291** is cited in D1S2 and D2S2 for the Danville Historic District in Pennsylvania.\n- **150** appears in D3S2 and D4S2 for the same district in Pennsylvania.\n- **48** is mentioned in D5S2 and D6S1 for the Downtown Danville Historic District in Virginia.\n- **272** is stated in D8S2 and D9S2 for the Danville Historic District in Virginia as of 1973.\n\nEach count refers to a distinct geographic and temporal instance of a \"Danville Historic District\" (Pennsylvania vs. Virginia, different years). These are distinct valid answers under the provided evidence."
}
